<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170655150800" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Nggunakake Variabel lan Simbol Aljabar</title><para id="fs-id1170655224522">Kanggo nulis ing wujud aljabar, saliyane wilangan lan variabel uga dibutuhake simbol operasi. Ana sawetara jinis simbol sing bakal digunakake.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654981807">Ana papat <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00005">operasi</term> aritmetika dhasar: <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00006">panambahan</term>, <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00007">pangurangan</term>, <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00008">ping-pingan</term>, lan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00009">paran</term>. Simbol sing digunakake kanggo nuduhake operasi kasebut kacathet ing tabel ngisor iki. Sawetara simbol kasebut mbokmenawa wis dikenal.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655178881" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni limang larik lan patang kolom. Larik kapisan ngemot irah-irahan saben kolom. Kolom kapisan diwenehi label &quot;Operasi&quot;, kolom kapindho &quot;Notasi&quot;, kolom katelu &quot;Diwaca&quot;, lan kolom pungkasan &quot;Asile yaiku...&quot;. Ing kolom &quot;Operasi&quot; ana tembung panambahan, pangurangan, ping-pingan, lan paran. Ing kolom &quot;Notasi&quot; ana wujud aljabar. Larik data kapisan nuduhake a, tandha tambah, b. Larik sabanjure nuduhake a, tandha kurang, b. Larik ping-pingan nuduhake limang wujud aljabar: a, tandha titik ping-pingan, b; ab; a ing sajrone tandha kurung diterusake b ing sajrone tandha kurung; a ing sajrone tandha kurung diterusake b; lan a diterusake b ing sajrone tandha kurung. Larik pungkasan nuduhake patang wujud aljabar. Ekspresi kapisan yaiku a, tandha para, b. Ekspresi kapindho yaiku a, garis miring, b. Ekspresi katelu yaiku a ing ndhuwur garis pecahan lan b ing ngisor garis pecahan. Ekspresi kapapat yaiku b ing njaba kurung para gapit lan a ing sajrone kurung para gapit. Ing kolom &quot;Diwaca&quot; ana frasa &quot;a ditambah b&quot;, &quot;a dikurangi b&quot;, &quot;a ping b&quot;, lan &quot;a dipara b&quot;. Ing kolom &quot;Asile yaiku...&quot; ana frasa &quot;gunggung a lan b&quot;, &quot;selisih a lan b&quot;, &quot;asil ping-pingan a lan b&quot;, lan &quot;asil paran a lan b; a diarani wilangan sing dipara lan b diarani pembagi&quot;.">
<tgroup cols="4">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Operasi</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Notasi</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Diwaca:</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Asile yaiku…</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Panambahan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> ditambah <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">gunggung <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Pangurangan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> dikurangi <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">selisih <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Ping-pingan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> ping <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">asil ping-pingan <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Paran</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mtext>/</m:mtext><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:menclose notation="longdiv"><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:menclose></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> dipara <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">asil paran <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis>; <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> diarani wilangan sing dipara, lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> diarani pembagi</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="fs-id1170655126801">Operasi kasebut ditindakake marang rong wilangan. Nalika ngowahi wujud simbol dadi basa Indonesia, utawa basa Indonesia dadi wujud simbol, gatekna tembung basa Indonesia “dari” (ing basa Jawa: “saka”) lan “dan” (ing basa Jawa: “lan”).</para>
<list id="fs-id1166424846753" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item><emphasis effect="italics">Selisih</emphasis> 9 lan 2 ateges njupuk 2 saka 9, kanthi tembung liya, 9 dikurangi 2, sing ditulis nganggo simbol dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item><emphasis effect="italics">Asil ping-pingan</emphasis> 4 lan 8 ateges ngitung 4 ping 8, kanthi tembung liya 4 ping 8, sing ditulis nganggo simbol dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
</list>
<para id="fs-id1170655004454">Ing aljabar, tandha silang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> ora digunakake kanggo nuduhake ping-pingan amarga tandha kasebut bisa njalari bingung. Apa 3<emphasis effect="italics">xy</emphasis> ateges <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> (“telu ping <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>”) utawa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> (telu ping <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> ping <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>)? Supaya cetha, gunakna <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>·</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> utawa tandha kurung kanggo ping-pingan.</para>
</section>
